{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "02ZH", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-stacks-in-groupoids}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2103e0dacbd76b3921d9bfa7162a35f5670260068fcfb74b8464450efb567fc9", "source_text": "Stacks in groupoids", "source_text_hash": "sha256:fac211df4eeb64b13d20e5008072ca951677659f82fc811709808aa359b75e49", "unit_id": "tag:02ZH:title"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "02ZH", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c12c5d2c8f88d927ed3f0f5008bd4d16ea79cfcfbca6a7f9242ae3a56a57fa7c", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nAmong stacks those which are fibred in groupoids are somewhat easier\nto comprehend. We redefine them as follows.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:65e72b126b30f10d8774058dccf2dbc745548d112acc0d0c6d12d7e845f600e2", "unit_id": "tag:02ZH:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "02ZH", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$p : \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$p : \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0006": "$U \\in \\Ob(\\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0007": "$x, y\\in \\Ob(\\mathcal{S}_U)$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathit{Isom}(x, y)$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{C}/U$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{U} = \\{U_i \\to U\\}$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0012": "$(x_i, \\phi_{ij})$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{U}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{categories-definition-fibred-groupoids}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-stack-in-groupoids}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:dcd2710c4024bef327fb3ec2a18830e6513ed4f80f58132aca5666c2bcfce021", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0daf74a2f22e7013adcc7a132dfecf0f232698c4712c77eaeab67ea6a1d577b0", "source_text": "A <TEXTITOPEN_0001>stack in groupoids<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> over a site <MATH_0001> is a\ncategory <MATH_0002> over <MATH_0003>\nsuch that\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004> is fibred\nin groupoids over <MATH_0005> (see\nCategories, Definition <REF_0001>),\n<STRUCT_0003> for all <MATH_0006>,\nfor all <MATH_0007> the presheaf\n<MATH_0008> is a sheaf on the site <MATH_0009>, and\n<STRUCT_0004> for all coverings <MATH_0010> in <MATH_0011>,\nall descent data <MATH_0012> for <MATH_0013> are effective.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a5a8fb7366fb7d8df3fd9d6810730b61bc7453411fa83773950416d160c8a36c", "unit_id": "tag:02ZI:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "02ZH", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c12c5d2c8f88d927ed3f0f5008bd4d16ea79cfcfbca6a7f9242ae3a56a57fa7c", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nUsually the hardest part to check is the third condition.\nHere is the lemma comparing this with the notion of a stack.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:36bef9fc2a21dcbcc830270892ebd181d37bbfea842a75d356b5cdf4ba02167c", "unit_id": "tag:02ZH:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02ZH", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$p : \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{S}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{S}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{S}$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-stack-in-groupoids-stack}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c30851aaf8649400d300ffa47d48eb592562094ae26be0acf32d306be1c9b861", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8d0fb380904c7f2f9406bce9d6bece657a71058ad16588c77dc80c0f33370132", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a category over <MATH_0003>.\nThe following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004> is a stack in groupoids over <MATH_0005>,\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0006> is a stack over <MATH_0007> and all\nfibre categories are groupoids, and\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0008> is fibred in groupoids over <MATH_0009>\nand is a stack over <MATH_0010>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2a63e4b596d2cd4ccb0b3fc83000207d09a0b4d4c69fe73e20fe597089ae4cb7", "unit_id": "tag:02ZJ:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02ZH", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{categories-lemma-fibred-groupoids}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7778d4d8ece209b24483794225e12db7d6d61958bd015ff9e4e79b57cca489c5", "source_text": "Omitted, but see Categories, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0ee66fd216c5648c403dda357455c6abf65648bfbaaa7e044ba5f8b6c9f59529", "unit_id": "tag:02ZJ:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02ZH", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$p : \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$p' : \\mathcal{S}' \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{S}$", "MATH_0005": "$p' : \\mathcal{S}' \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{categories-lemma-fibred-gives-fibred-groupoids}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-stack-gives-stack-groupoids}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f91566dafd0e5a828585e164135f662d338ee8c7ca5d665e8160c594c1600a76", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4a19e95599ff1677f0e6cb064d121e4eac6e10a1404ee6bea094f7e878fe91d2", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a stack.\nLet <MATH_0003>\nbe the category fibred in groupoids associated to <MATH_0004>\nconstructed in\nCategories, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nThen <MATH_0005> is a stack in groupoids.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:96f199ed74faaab3a373c27b5bf03583ea90a285f4b8b3a2c97b6c90fb3cfa54", "unit_id": "tag:03YI:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02ZH", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{S}'$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{S}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{S}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{S}'$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{S}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-stack-equivalences}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3f71835ba366eb75a9820d909b65eed9433edcfdf11955ea5a81d54811d8fc76", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c3d8d5a26b3bcf8521c6674b8c3a137560158a0d3366aaf78b812f7e6724e441", "source_text": "Recall that the morphisms in <MATH_0001> are exactly the\nstrongly cartesian morphisms of <MATH_0002>, and that any isomorphism of\n<MATH_0003> is such a morphism. Hence descent data in <MATH_0004>\nare exactly the same thing as descent data in <MATH_0005>. Now apply\nLemma <REF_0001>. Some details omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b45cd0e2e3ac0e3cecab521874391ef59300f102ea82c12c7325ea1fa5aa1cbe", "unit_id": "tag:03YI:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02ZH", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{S}_1$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{S}_2$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{S}_1$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{S}_2$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{S}_1$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{S}_2$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{C}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-stack-in-groupoids-equivalent}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7a06d8cecc2e4ffe3e65ef19e939456917e6e4d2d4b8b74b82b626d9d5802132", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:74c2f3c00b9498c52d0330af792f412ea48e6db2bb3fed7a76d77215c3478fd4", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a site.\nLet <MATH_0002>, <MATH_0003> be categories over <MATH_0004>.\nSuppose that <MATH_0005> and <MATH_0006> are equivalent\nas categories over <MATH_0007>.\nThen <MATH_0008> is a stack in groupoids over <MATH_0009> if and only if\n<MATH_0010> is a stack in groupoids over <MATH_0011>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6f6b24582265b51cf7965c9785ab935a52183f117e07fc25977c1c23ed707cca", "unit_id": "tag:042X:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02ZH", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-stack-in-groupoids-stack}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-stack-equivalent}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b91961e3d00871dd277472dd7fb6c6a5281fb227da27f9e4733799880a844c89", "source_text": "Follows by combining\nLemmas <REF_0001> and <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2ced788cd47ebbcd9825cea30e8972534142e4f864eca03bb91970cacd20e749", "unit_id": "tag:042X:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "02ZH", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$2$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b7f4426e146c69032002ddf432e538a0d19d466c5357b99a32faad4854a4be1a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5ec260767ad614b371f69fa61806c3848349087c48523c757e243ea6062a824a", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe <MATH_0001>-category of stacks in groupoids over <MATH_0002>\nis defined as follows.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6c88d5958cfff3406392e848ef2a0242c9a09ee4a7ddd405396f6c31dbd71699", "unit_id": "tag:02ZH:prose-0003"}
